  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It seems like I get this message on the HUD when changing into a different avatar, then changing back to the one I was in previously. It will continue to show up each time you change into something you've already worn during your session. Hope this gets patched soon.\n\nI don't think it's appropriate to have it as a HUD message after using the avatar menu; it's quite redundant, when it already displays the message in the avatar menu. The only use case that I see this HUD popup for, is for clicking on avatar pedestals.",
